            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Hypothalamic POMC neurons contribute to the regulation of energy homeostasis and glucose metabolism. In this issue of Neuron, Yang et al. (2012) show that the mTOR pathway has a pivotal role in deterioration of POMC neurons during age-dependent obesity.</AbstractText>
